{"route":"/","title":"BIM Staffing & Engineering Services UAE | ENGISOFT","description":"ENGISOFT Engineering provides BIM staffing, verified engineering talent, BIM outsourcing and digital engineering services in Dubai, UAE and GCC.","robots":"max-image-preview:large","canonical":"https://engisoftengineering.com/","og":{"type":"website","title":"BIM Staffing & Engineering Services UAE | ENGISOFT","description":"ENGISOFT Engineering provides BIM staffing, verified engineering talent, BIM outsourcing and digital engineering services in Dubai, UAE and GCC.","url":"https://engisoftengineering.com/","image":"https://engisoftengineering.com/assets/img/og-default.jpg","siteName":"ENGISOFT Engineering","locale":"en_US"},"twitter":"summary_large_image","jsonld":[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"ProfessionalService","@id":"https://engisoftengineering.com/#organization","name":"ENGISOFT Engineering","url":"https://engisoftengineering.com/","logo":"https://engisoftengineering.com/wp-content/themes/engisoft/assets/img/favicon.svg","image":"https://engisoftengineering.com/wp-content/uploads/engisoft-media/img/c-hand.jpg","email":"enquiry@engisoftengineering.com","telephone":"+971 58 867 2901","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"Office 608, Apricot Tower","addressLocality":"Dubai","addressRegion":"Dubai Silicon Oasis","addressCountry":"AE"},"areaServed":["AE","SA","QA","BH","KW","OM"],"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/company/14517437/","https://www.instagram.com/engisoft.engineering/","https://www.facebook.com/Global.BIM.Leader","https://twitter.com/ENGISOFTDUBAI"]},{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://engisoftengineering.com/#website","url":"https://engisoftengineering.com/","name":"ENGISOFT Engineering","publisher":{"@id":"https://engisoftengineering.com/#organization"}}]}],"caseStudy":false,"main":"\n<section class=\"hero\" aria-label=\"Scroll to build\">\n  <div class=\"hero-pin\" id=\"heroPin\">\n    <canvas id=\"seq\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Drone footage of a building project, from cleared site to finished villa\"></canvas>\n    <div class=\"shade\"></div>\n    <div class=\"chapters\">\n      <article class=\"ch is-on\" data-name=\"ENGISOFT\"><p class=\"lab\">01 &middot; BIM staffing &amp; engineering, Dubai</p><h1 class=\"display\">Beyond BIM staffing.<br><em>Verified talent. Assured performance.</em></h1><p class=\"lead\">ENGISOFT Engineering connects AEC organizations with technically assessed BIM professionals, intelligent workforce solutions and digital engineering expertise across the UAE, GCC and international markets.</p></article>\n      <article class=\"ch\" data-name=\"Structure\"><p class=\"lab\">02 &middot; Structure</p><h2 class=\"display\">Coordinated<br><em>below ground.</em></h2><p class=\"lead\">Concrete and steel models coordinated for constructability and quantity take-off, from footings up.</p></article>\n      <article class=\"ch\" data-name=\"Coordination\"><p class=\"lab\">03 &middot; Coordination</p><h2 class=\"display\">Clash-free<br><em>before site.</em></h2><p class=\"lead\">Structure, architecture and every MEP route federated and clash-tested floor by floor.</p></article>\n      <article class=\"ch\" data-name=\"Detailing\"><p class=\"lab\">04 &middot; Detailing</p><h2 class=\"display\">Drawn from<br><em>the model.</em></h2><p class=\"lead\">Shop and fabrication drawings extracted from coordinated models to reduce site discrepancies.</p></article>\n      <article class=\"ch\" data-name=\"Handover\"><p class=\"lab\">05 &middot; Handover</p><h2 class=\"display\">Built for<br><em>what comes next.</em></h2><p class=\"lead\">As-built models with COBie output, ready for facility management.</p></article>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hero-stats\" aria-label=\"ENGISOFT in numbers\"><div><b><span data-n=\"400\">400</span><sup>+</sup></b><span>Professionals deployed</span></div><div><b><span data-n=\"250\">250</span><sup>+</sup></b><span>Projects supported</span></div><div><b><span data-n=\"3\">3</span>–<span data-n=\"9\">9</span></b><span>Days from request to start</span></div><div><b><span data-n=\"18\">18</span></b><span>Specialist BIM &amp; engineering roles</span></div></div>\n    <div class=\"lod\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Level of development<b id=\"lodN\">100</b></div>\n    <div class=\"hud\"><div class=\"hud-l\"><b id=\"pct\">0%</b><span id=\"chName\">ENGISOFT</span></div><div class=\"steps\" id=\"steps\"><i><b></b></i><i><b></b></i><i><b></b></i><i><b></b></i><i><b></b></i></div><div class=\"hint\" id=\"hint\"><i></i>Scroll to build</div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"mani paper pad\" aria-label=\"About ENGISOFT\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <p class=\"lab\">At a glance &middot; Dubai Silicon Oasis</p>\n    <p class=\"big\" id=\"mani\" style=\"margin-top:28px\">One partner for BIM people <em>and BIM delivery.</em></p>\n    <div class=\"facts\">\n      <div><b><span data-n=\"400\">400</span><sup>+</sup></b><span>Professionals deployed</span></div><div><b><span data-n=\"250\">250</span><sup>+</sup></b><span>Projects supported</span></div><div><b>3–9</b><span>Days from request to start</span></div><div><b><span data-n=\"18\">18</span></b><span>Specialist BIM &amp; engineering roles</span></div>    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"bone pad\" aria-label=\"What we do\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">What we do</p><h2 class=\"h2\">Three ways we support <em>your projects.</em></h2></div><p class=\"lead\">Coordinated models. Reliable people. Delivered on your timeline.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"flow f3\"><div class=\"rv\"><b>01</b><div><p class=\"lab\">Lead offer</p><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">BIM Staffing &amp; Workforce</h3><p>Onsite and remote BIM professionals, dedicated teams and staff augmentation.</p><p style=\"margin-top:12px\"><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/\">Explore &rarr;</a></p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>02</b><div><p class=\"lab\">Delivery</p><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">BIM &amp; Digital Engineering</h3><p>Modelling, coordination, documentation and Revit / Dynamo automation.</p><p style=\"margin-top:12px\"><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-services/\">Explore &rarr;</a></p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>03</b><div><p class=\"lab\">Our difference</p><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">Verified Talent</h3><p>Every professional technically assessed before they join your project.</p><p style=\"margin-top:12px\"><a class=\"u\" href=\"/verified-talent/\">Explore &rarr;</a></p></div></div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"info-scale\" aria-label=\"Scale your BIM team\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <p class=\"lab\">Why outsource your BIM</p>\n    <h2 class=\"display\">Scale your BIM team up or down, <em>without adding headcount.</em></h2>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"paper pad info-cap\" aria-label=\"Flexible capacity\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Flexible capacity</p><h2 class=\"h2\">Your workload moves. <em>Your team should too.</em></h2></div>\n      <ul class=\"cap-key\"><li><i class=\"k-dem\"></i>Project demand</li><li><i class=\"k-fix\"></i>Fixed in-house team</li><li><i class=\"k-eng\"></i>ENGISOFT capacity</li></ul></div>\n    <figure class=\"cap-fig\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 1000 360\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"capT capD\">\n        <title id=\"capT\">Project demand compared with a fixed in-house team and ENGISOFT capacity over a year</title>\n        <desc id=\"capD\">Demand rises and falls through the year. A fixed in-house team is overloaded at the peaks and idle in the troughs, while ENGISOFT capacity steps up and down with demand.</desc>\n        <line class=\"cap-grid\" x1=\"40\" x2=\"980\" y1=\"320\" y2=\"320\"/><line class=\"cap-grid\" x1=\"40\" x2=\"980\" y1=\"250\" y2=\"250\"/><line class=\"cap-grid\" x1=\"40\" x2=\"980\" y1=\"180\" y2=\"180\"/><line class=\"cap-grid\" x1=\"40\" x2=\"980\" y1=\"110\" y2=\"110\"/><line class=\"cap-grid\" x1=\"40\" x2=\"980\" y1=\"40\" y2=\"40\"/>        <path class=\"cap-area\" d=\"M40 236 C54.2 233.2 97.0 229.5 125.5 219.2 C153.9 208.9 182.4 190.3 210.9 174.4 C239.4 158.5 267.9 140.8 296.4 124.0 C324.8 107.2 353.3 76.4 381.8 73.6 C410.3 70.8 438.8 93.2 467.3 107.2 C495.8 121.2 524.2 160.4 552.7 157.6 C581.2 154.8 609.7 107.2 638.2 90.4 C666.7 73.6 695.2 50.3 723.6 56.8 C752.1 63.3 780.6 106.3 809.1 129.6 C837.6 152.9 866.1 180.9 894.5 196.8 C923.0 212.7 965.8 220.1 980.0 224.8 L980.0 320.0 L40.0 320.0 Z\"/>\n        <rect class=\"cap-over\" x=\"296.36363636364\" y=\"56.8\" width=\"512.72727272727\" height=\"95.2\" rx=\"10\"/>\n        <text class=\"cap-note\" x=\"552.72727272727\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Peaks: in-house team overloaded</text>\n        <text class=\"cap-note\" x=\"91.272727272727\" y=\"264\">Troughs: paying for idle time</text>\n        <line class=\"cap-fix\" x1=\"40\" x2=\"980\" y1=\"152\" y2=\"152\"/>\n        <path class=\"cap-eng\" d=\"M40.0 208.0 L82.7 208.0 L82.7 208.0 L168.2 208.0 L168.2 152.0 L253.6 152.0 L253.6 96.0 L339.1 96.0 L339.1 40.0 L424.5 40.0 L424.5 96.0 L510.0 96.0 L510.0 124.0 L595.5 124.0 L595.5 68.0 L680.9 68.0 L680.9 40.0 L766.4 40.0 L766.4 96.0 L851.8 96.0 L851.8 180.0 L937.3 180.0 L937.3 208.0 L980.0 208.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"cap-dem\" d=\"M40 236 C54.2 233.2 97.0 229.5 125.5 219.2 C153.9 208.9 182.4 190.3 210.9 174.4 C239.4 158.5 267.9 140.8 296.4 124.0 C324.8 107.2 353.3 76.4 381.8 73.6 C410.3 70.8 438.8 93.2 467.3 107.2 C495.8 121.2 524.2 160.4 552.7 157.6 C581.2 154.8 609.7 107.2 638.2 90.4 C666.7 73.6 695.2 50.3 723.6 56.8 C752.1 63.3 780.6 106.3 809.1 129.6 C837.6 152.9 866.1 180.9 894.5 196.8 C923.0 212.7 965.8 220.1 980.0 224.8\"/>\n        <text class=\"cap-x\" x=\"40\" y=\"348\" text-anchor=\"middle\">J</text><text class=\"cap-x\" x=\"125.45454545455\" y=\"348\" text-anchor=\"middle\">F</text><text class=\"cap-x\" x=\"210.90909090909\" y=\"348\" text-anchor=\"middle\">M</text><text class=\"cap-x\" x=\"296.36363636364\" y=\"348\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A</text><text class=\"cap-x\" x=\"381.81818181818\" y=\"348\" text-anchor=\"middle\">M</text><text class=\"cap-x\" x=\"467.27272727273\" y=\"348\" text-anchor=\"middle\">J</text><text class=\"cap-x\" x=\"552.72727272727\" y=\"348\" text-anchor=\"middle\">J</text><text class=\"cap-x\" x=\"638.18181818182\" y=\"348\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A</text><text class=\"cap-x\" x=\"723.63636363636\" y=\"348\" text-anchor=\"middle\">S</text><text class=\"cap-x\" x=\"809.09090909091\" y=\"348\" text-anchor=\"middle\">O</text><text class=\"cap-x\" x=\"894.54545454545\" y=\"348\" text-anchor=\"middle\">N</text><text class=\"cap-x\" x=\"980\" y=\"348\" text-anchor=\"middle\">D</text>      </svg>\n      <figcaption>Illustrative workload over a year. ENGISOFT capacity follows the programme: up for peaks, bids and deadlines, down after handover.</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:34px\"><a class=\"btn dark\" href=\"/bim-staffing/outsourcing/\">BIM resource outsourcing <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a><a class=\"u\" style=\"align-self:center\" href=\"/why-engisoft/\">Why outsource to ENGISOFT</a></div>  </div>\n</section>\n\t\n<section class=\"hand\" aria-label=\"Quality before every issue\">\n  <div class=\"hand-pin\">\n    <div class=\"hand-media\"><video muted loop playsinline preload=\"metadata\" aria-label=\"BIM modeller working on a 3D model at a workstation\"><source src=\"/assets/video/bim-workstation.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><div class=\"hand-grad\"></div></div>\n    <div class=\"hand-copy\"><p class=\"lab\" style=\"color:var(--ye)\">Quality before every issue</p><h2 class=\"display\" style=\"margin-top:18px;color:#fff\">Checked,<em>then issued.</em></h2></div>\n    <div class=\"cards\">\n      <div class=\"card\"><b>Healthy</b><p>Model health review before each issue.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><b>Tracked</b><p>Clash reports with resolution tracking.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><b>Logged</b><p>Revision log and transmittal record.</p></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"paper pad\" aria-label=\"Workforce solutions\">\n  <div class=\"wrap wf\">\n    <div><p class=\"lab\">BIM staffing</p><h2 class=\"h2\">Capacity in the shape <em>your project needs.</em></h2>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Beyond BIM staffing: technically assessed BIM professionals, embedded onsite or working remotely in your CDE, with a technical escalation route behind them.</p>\n    <a class=\"btn dark\" style=\"margin-top:34px\" href=\"/bim-staffing/\">BIM staffing solutions <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div>\n    <ul class=\"wlist\"><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/onsite/\"><span>01</span>Onsite BIM Staffing<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/remote/\"><span>02</span>Remote BIM Staffing<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/outsourcing/\"><span>03</span>BIM Resource Outsourcing<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/dedicated-teams/\"><span>04</span>Dedicated BIM Teams<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/staff-augmentation/\"><span>05</span>BIM Staff Augmentation<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/mobilization/\"><span>06</span>BIM Workforce Mobilization<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/workforce-continuity/\"><span>07</span>BIM Workforce Continuity<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/temporary/\"><span>08</span>Temporary BIM Staffing<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/long-term/\"><span>09</span>Long-Term BIM Staffing<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/technical-recruitment/\"><span>10</span>BIM Technical Recruitment<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"bone pad\" aria-label=\"Engineering staffing\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Engineering staffing</p><h2 class=\"h2\">Professionals <em>we deploy.</em></h2></div><a class=\"btn dark\" href=\"/request-talent/\">Request BIM professionals <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div>\n    <div class=\"models\"><a class=\"model rv\" href=\"/engineering-staffing/bim-architects/\"><span class=\"num\">01 / ARCHITECTURE</span><h3 class=\"h3\">BIM Architects</h3><p>Architects who model, document and coordinate in Revit, from concept to construction drawings.</p><span class=\"sv-go\">Explore <i>&rarr;</i></span></a><a class=\"model rv\" href=\"/engineering-staffing/architectural-bim-engineers/\"><span class=\"num\">02 / ARCHITECTURE</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Architectural BIM Engineers</h3><p>Engineers who carry the architectural model through technical design, coordination and documentation.</p><span class=\"sv-go\">Explore <i>&rarr;</i></span></a><a class=\"model rv\" href=\"/engineering-staffing/structural-bim-engineers/\"><span class=\"num\">03 / STRUCTURE</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Structural BIM Engineers</h3><p>Engineers who model structure, coordinate it with every trade and prepare it for detailing.</p><span class=\"sv-go\">Explore <i>&rarr;</i></span></a><a class=\"model rv\" href=\"/engineering-staffing/mep-bim-engineers/\"><span class=\"num\">04 / MEP</span><h3 class=\"h3\">MEP BIM Engineers</h3><p>Mechanical, electrical and plumbing specialists who route, coordinate and document building services.</p><span class=\"sv-go\">Explore <i>&rarr;</i></span></a><a class=\"model rv\" href=\"/engineering-staffing/mechanical-bim-engineers/\"><span class=\"num\">05 / MEP</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Mechanical BIM Engineers</h3><p>HVAC and piping specialists who model, size-check and coordinate mechanical services in the building.</p><span class=\"sv-go\">Explore <i>&rarr;</i></span></a><a class=\"model rv\" href=\"/engineering-staffing/electrical-bim-engineers/\"><span class=\"num\">06 / MEP</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Electrical BIM Engineers</h3><p>Electrical specialists who model containment and services and keep them clear of every other trade.</p><span class=\"sv-go\">Explore <i>&rarr;</i></span></a><a class=\"model rv\" href=\"/engineering-staffing/plumbing-bim-engineers/\"><span class=\"num\">07 / MEP</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Plumbing BIM Engineers</h3><p>Specialists in gravity drainage, water supply and fire-fighting systems, modelled with the falls and clearances they need.</p><span class=\"sv-go\">Explore <i>&rarr;</i></span></a><a class=\"model rv\" href=\"/engineering-staffing/infrastructure-bim-engineers/\"><span class=\"num\">08 / INFRASTRUCTURE</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Infrastructure BIM Engineers</h3><p>Civil 3D specialists for roads, utilities and rail, coordinated with the buildings around them.</p><span class=\"sv-go\">Explore <i>&rarr;</i></span></a><a class=\"model rv\" href=\"/engineering-staffing/landscape-bim-architects/\"><span class=\"num\">09 / ARCHITECTURE</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Landscape BIM Architects</h3><p>Landscape specialists who model the ground, hardscape and planting with the same discipline as the building.</p><span class=\"sv-go\">Explore <i>&rarr;</i></span></a><a class=\"model rv\" href=\"/engineering-staffing/interior-bim-architects/\"><span class=\"num\">10 / ARCHITECTURE</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Interior BIM Architects</h3><p>Interior specialists who model fit-out, joinery and finishes ready for the workshop and site.</p><span class=\"sv-go\">Explore <i>&rarr;</i></span></a><a class=\"model rv\" href=\"/engineering-staffing/bim-coordinators/\"><span class=\"num\">11 / BIM MANAGEMENT</span><h3 class=\"h3\">BIM Coordinators</h3><p>Coordinators who federate the models, run the clash cycles and keep the issue log moving.</p><span class=\"sv-go\">Explore <i>&rarr;</i></span></a><a class=\"model rv\" href=\"/engineering-staffing/bim-managers/\"><span class=\"num\">12 / BIM MANAGEMENT</span><h3 class=\"h3\">BIM Managers</h3><p>Managers who set the BEP, run the CDE and keep every discipline to the same standard.</p><span class=\"sv-go\">Explore <i>&rarr;</i></span></a><a class=\"model rv\" href=\"/engineering-staffing/bim-modelers/\"><span class=\"num\">13 / MODELLING</span><h3 class=\"h3\">BIM Modelers</h3><p>Modelers who build discipline models to your LOD matrix and keep them current through design change.</p><span class=\"sv-go\">Explore <i>&rarr;</i></span></a><a class=\"model rv\" href=\"/engineering-staffing/cad-draftsmen/\"><span class=\"num\">14 / DRAFTING</span><h3 class=\"h3\">CAD Draftsmen</h3><p>Draftsmen who produce and maintain 2D drawing sets to your CAD standards.</p><span class=\"sv-go\">Explore <i>&rarr;</i></span></a><a class=\"model rv\" href=\"/engineering-staffing/rebar-detailers/\"><span class=\"num\">15 / STRUCTURE</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Rebar Detailers</h3><p>Detailers who turn structural design into buildable reinforcement and schedules.</p><span class=\"sv-go\">Explore <i>&rarr;</i></span></a><a class=\"model rv\" href=\"/engineering-staffing/civil-3d-engineers/\"><span class=\"num\">16 / INFRASTRUCTURE</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Civil 3D Engineers</h3><p>Infrastructure specialists who build corridors, surfaces and utility networks in Civil 3D.</p><span class=\"sv-go\">Explore <i>&rarr;</i></span></a><a class=\"model rv\" href=\"/engineering-staffing/scan-to-bim-specialists/\"><span class=\"num\">17 / SPECIALIZED</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Scan-to-BIM Specialists</h3><p>Modelers experienced in point clouds, tolerances and as-built documentation.</p><span class=\"sv-go\">Explore <i>&rarr;</i></span></a><a class=\"model rv\" href=\"/engineering-staffing/bim-automation-specialists/\"><span class=\"num\">18 / SPECIALIZED</span><h3 class=\"h3\">BIM Automation Specialists</h3><p>Specialists who remove repetitive modelling and documentation work with Dynamo and Revit scripting.</p><span class=\"sv-go\">Explore <i>&rarr;</i></span></a></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"svc\" aria-label=\"Disciplines\">\n  <div class=\"svc-pin\">\n    <div class=\"svc-head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Disciplines</p><h2 class=\"h2\">What we <em>model.</em></h2></div><p class=\"count\"><b id=\"svcN\">01</b>/06</p></div>\n    <div class=\"stage\">\n      <a class=\"sc\" href=\"/bim-services/architectural-bim/\"><img width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-arch.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Curved glass curtain wall facade\" sizes=\"auto, 360px\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-arch.jpg 1920w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-arch-300x200.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-arch-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-arch-768x512.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-arch-1536x1024.jpg 1536w\" /><span class=\"sc-n\">01 / Architecture</span><div class=\"sc-t\"><h3 class=\"h3\">Architectural BIM</h3><p>Design intent preserved from concept to construction documentation.</p></div></a><a class=\"sc\" href=\"/bim-services/structural-bim/\"><video muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\" data-src=\"/assets/video/tower-rise.mp4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></video><span class=\"sc-n\">02 / Structure</span><div class=\"sc-t\"><h3 class=\"h3\">Structural BIM</h3><p>Concrete and steel coordinated for constructability.</p></div></a><a class=\"sc\" href=\"/bim-services/mep-bim/\"><img width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-mep.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Engineer inspecting red fire protection pipework in a plant room\" sizes=\"auto, 360px\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-mep.jpg 1920w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-mep-300x200.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-mep-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-mep-768x512.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-mep-1536x1024.jpg 1536w\" /><span class=\"sc-n\">03 / MEP</span><div class=\"sc-t\"><h3 class=\"h3\">MEP BIM</h3><p>Clash-free services, ready for shop drawings.</p></div></a><a class=\"sc\" href=\"/bim-services/infrastructure-bim/\"><img width=\"1920\" height=\"1440\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-infra.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Aerial view of a highway interchange with green landscaping\" sizes=\"auto, 360px\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-infra.jpg 1920w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-infra-300x225.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-infra-1024x768.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-infra-768x576.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-infra-1536x1152.jpg 1536w\" /><span class=\"sc-n\">04 / Infrastructure</span><div class=\"sc-t\"><h3 class=\"h3\">Infrastructure BIM</h3><p>Corridors, grading and utilities in Civil 3D.</p></div></a><a class=\"sc\" href=\"/bim-services/scan-to-bim/\"><video muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\" data-src=\"/assets/video/reality-capture.mp4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></video><span class=\"sc-n\">05 / Reality capture</span><div class=\"sc-t\"><h3 class=\"h3\">Scan-to-BIM</h3><p>Point clouds turned into tolerance-aware as-built models.</p></div></a><a class=\"sc\" href=\"/bim-services/bim-coordination/\"><video muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\" data-src=\"/assets/video/mep-model.mp4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></video><span class=\"sc-n\">06 / Coordination</span><div class=\"sc-t\"><h3 class=\"h3\">BIM Coordination</h3><p>Clash logs, issue owners and version control.</p></div></a>    </div>\n    <div class=\"svc-foot\"><div class=\"segs\" id=\"segs\"><i><b></b></i><i><b></b></i><i><b></b></i><i><b></b></i><i><b></b></i><i><b></b></i></div><a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"/bim-services/\">All 16 services <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"coal pad\" aria-label=\"Live federated model\">\n  <div class=\"wrap bimx\">\n    <div>\n      <p class=\"lab\">Live model</p><h2 class=\"h2\">One federated <em>model.</em></h2>\n      <p class=\"lead\">This is a working model, not a picture. Switch disciplines, change the level of development and run the same clash test our coordinators run in Navisworks. Drag to orbit.</p>\n      <div class=\"ctrls\">\n        <div><p class=\"lab\">Disciplines</p><div class=\"tog\" id=\"vDisc\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Disciplines\"><button aria-pressed=\"true\" data-d=\"arch\"><i></i>Architecture</button><button aria-pressed=\"true\" data-d=\"struct\"><i></i>Structure</button><button aria-pressed=\"true\" data-d=\"mep\"><i></i>MEP</button></div></div>\n        <div><p class=\"lab\">Level of development</p><div class=\"tog\" id=\"vLod\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level of development\"><button aria-pressed=\"false\" data-l=\"100\">100</button><button aria-pressed=\"false\" data-l=\"200\">200</button><button aria-pressed=\"true\" data-l=\"300\">300</button><button aria-pressed=\"false\" data-l=\"400\">400</button></div></div>\n        <button class=\"btn runclash\" id=\"runClash\" aria-controls=\"creport\">Run clash test <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></button>\n        <div class=\"creport\" id=\"creport\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"viewer\"><canvas id=\"bimViewer\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Interactive 3D BIM model of a four-storey building with architecture, structure and MEP services\"></canvas>\n      <div class=\"vhud\"><span><b id=\"vState\">Federated</b> &middot; LOD <span id=\"vLodN\">300</span></span><span>4 levels &middot; 3 disciplines</span></div>\n      <div class=\"vfoot\"><div class=\"legend\"><span><i style=\"background:#BDB8B0\"></i>Architecture</span><span><i style=\"background:#A8A29A\"></i>Structure</span><span><i style=\"background:#E57126\"></i>Duct</span><span><i style=\"background:#FBBD02\"></i>Cable tray</span><span><i style=\"background:#FF5C48\"></i>Fire</span></div><span>Drag to orbit</span></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"proc\" aria-label=\"How a BIM package runs\">\n  <div class=\"proc-pin\">\n    <div class=\"proc-top\"><div><p class=\"lab\">How we work</p><h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">Five stages<br><em>to every issue.</em></h2></div><p class=\"lead\" style=\"max-width:34ch\">The same delivery workflow on every BIM package, whatever the discipline.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"track\" id=\"track\"><article class=\"step intro\"><span class=\"lab\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">Delivery workflow</span><p>Standards-driven modelling, documented QA before each issue, and a clear deliverable register.</p></article><article class=\"step\"><img srcset=\"/assets/img/plan-desk-960.jpg 960w, /assets/img/plan-desk.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"540px\" src=\"/assets/img/plan-desk.jpg\" alt=\"Architectural drawing on a desk with a pen\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"step-n\">STEP 01</span><div class=\"step-t\"><h3 class=\"h3\">Scope &amp; BEP</h3><p>Deliverables, LOD/LOI matrix and standards confirmed before a single element is modelled.</p></div></article><article class=\"step\"><img srcset=\"/assets/img/review-960.jpg 960w, /assets/img/review.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"540px\" src=\"/assets/img/review.jpg\" alt=\"Two engineers reviewing a 3D model on a laptop\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"step-n\">STEP 02</span><div class=\"step-t\"><h3 class=\"h3\">Set up</h3><p>Templates, shared parameters and work-sharing prepared to your project standards.</p></div></article><article class=\"step\"><img srcset=\"/assets/img/c-struct-960.jpg 960w, /assets/img/c-struct.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"540px\" src=\"/assets/img/c-struct.jpg\" alt=\"Aerial view of a building frame on a hillside site\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"step-n\">STEP 03</span><div class=\"step-t\"><h3 class=\"h3\">Model</h3><p>Discipline models and sheets produced, then cross-checked against each other.</p></div></article><article class=\"step\"><img srcset=\"/assets/img/onsite-960.jpg 960w, /assets/img/onsite.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"540px\" src=\"/assets/img/onsite.jpg\" alt=\"Engineer in a hard hat reviewing a model on a tablet on site\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"step-n\">STEP 04</span><div class=\"step-t\"><h3 class=\"h3\">QA/QC</h3><p>Model health, standards and clash checks run before every issue.</p></div></article><article class=\"step\"><img srcset=\"/assets/img/c-hand-960.jpg 960w, /assets/img/c-hand.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"540px\" src=\"/assets/img/c-hand.jpg\" alt=\"Aerial view of a completed villa roof and terraces at night\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"step-n\">STEP 05</span><div class=\"step-t\"><h3 class=\"h3\">Issue</h3><p>Issued through the agreed CDE with a revision log and transmittal record.</p></div></article></div>\n    <div class=\"pbar\"><i id=\"pbar\"></i></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"coal pad\" aria-label=\"Selected work\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Featured projects</p><h2 class=\"h2\">Full-discipline BIM, <em>up to LOD 500.</em></h2></div><a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"/case-studies/\">All case studies <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div>\n    <div class=\"bento\">\n              <a class=\"bt b1\" href=\"/case-studies/reem-mall-abu-dhabi/\"><img width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-pj-comm-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Commercial building facade with repeating window bays\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width:900px) 100vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-pj-comm-1.jpg 1920w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-pj-comm-1-300x200.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-pj-comm-1-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-pj-comm-1-768x512.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-pj-comm-1-1536x1024.jpg 1536w\" /><span class=\"tag\">Multi-discipline · LOD 500</span><span class=\"arr\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></span><h3 class=\"h3\">Reem Mall</h3><p>Mega project: every discipline to LOD 500 with COBie.</p></a>\n              <a class=\"bt b2\" href=\"/case-studies/museum-of-the-future-jet-link-bridge/\"><img width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-w-steel.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Steel frame of an industrial building\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width:900px) 100vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-w-steel.jpg 1920w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-w-steel-300x200.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-w-steel-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-w-steel-768x512.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-w-steel-1536x1024.jpg 1536w\" /><span class=\"tag\">Structural · </span><span class=\"arr\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></span><h3 class=\"h3\">Museum of the Future – Jet-Link Bridge</h3><p>Steel bridge structure coordinated with existing buildings.</p></a>\n                <div class=\"bt b3\"><span class=\"lab\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">250+ projects supported</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Landmark work across the UAE and KSA, from malls and metro stations to EXPO 2020.</h3></div>\n                <a class=\"bt b4\" href=\"/case-studies/enoc-staff-accommodation/\"><img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-c-estate.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Aerial view of a residential villa estate under construction\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width:900px) 100vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-c-estate.jpg 1920w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-c-estate-300x169.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-c-estate-1024x576.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-c-estate-768x432.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-c-estate-1536x864.jpg 1536w\" /><span class=\"tag\">Multi-discipline · Dubai</span><span class=\"arr\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></span><h3 class=\"h3\">ENOC Staff Accommodation</h3><p>All disciplines to LOD 500 with COBie.</p></a>\n              <a class=\"bt b5\" href=\"/case-studies/ghadan-21-e25-streetscape/\"><img width=\"1920\" height=\"1372\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-w-road.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Highway at night with light trails\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width:900px) 100vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-w-road.jpg 1920w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-w-road-300x214.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-w-road-1024x732.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-w-road-768x549.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-w-road-1536x1098.jpg 1536w\" /><span class=\"tag\">Infrastructure · LOD 400</span><span class=\"arr\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></span><h3 class=\"h3\">Ghadan 21 – E25 Streetscape</h3><p>LOD 400 infrastructure and landscape, 5D take-off and site coordination.</p></a>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"paper pad\" aria-label=\"Speed to deploy\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Speed to deploy</p><h2 class=\"h2\">From request to a working <em>BIM professional.</em></h2></div><p class=\"tl-pill\">Request to start: typically <b>3–9 days</b></p></div>\n  <ol class=\"tl\" style=\"--n:5\"><li class=\"rv\"><span class=\"tl-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><b>Day 0</b><h3>Share your requirement</h3><p>Role, software, sector, onsite or remote.</p></li><li class=\"rv\"><span class=\"tl-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><b>1–3 days</b><h3>Receive a verified shortlist</h3><p>Assessed profiles with competency passports.</p></li><li class=\"rv\"><span class=\"tl-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><b>1–3 days</b><h3>Interview &amp; select</h3><p>You meet the shortlist and choose.</p></li><li class=\"rv\"><span class=\"tl-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><b>1–3 days</b><h3>Onboard &amp; mobilise</h3><p>Set up in your standards, onsite or remote.</p></li><li class=\"rv\"><span class=\"tl-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><b>Ongoing</b><h3>Performance check-ins</h3><p>Regular reviews and continuity cover.</p></li></ol>\n</div></section>\n\t\n<section class=\"coal pad\" aria-label=\"Track record\">\n  <div class=\"wrap wf\">\n    <div><p class=\"lab\">Track record</p><h2 class=\"h2\">Trusted by leading <em>UAE firms.</em></h2>\n    <p class=\"lead\" style=\"color:var(--bone)\">400+ BIM professionals deployed in the UAE and 250+ projects supported, for contractors, consultants and developers across the UAE and GCC.</p>\n    <a class=\"btn\" style=\"margin-top:34px\" href=\"/testimonials/\">What clients say <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div>\n    <div><div class=\"chiprow \"><span>ALEC</span><span>AMANA</span><span>Innovo</span><span>Bishop Design</span><span>ECC</span><span>Engineering Contracting</span><span>Killa Design</span><span>Kling Consult</span><span>Mirage</span><span>Obermeyer</span><span>Parsons</span><span>U+A</span><span>+ more across the UAE &amp; GCC</span></div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"pad\" aria-label=\"Industries\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Industries</p><h2 class=\"h2\">Experience across the <em>built environment.</em></h2></div><p class=\"lead\">Sector experience across twelve industries, each with its own coordination pressure points. Open one to see where BIM matters most.</p></div>\n    <ul class=\"ind\"><li><button aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"ind01\"><b>01</b><strong>High-Rise Buildings</strong><span>Coordination-heavy towers need deep multi-discipline BIM discipline.</span><em aria-hidden=\"true\"></em></button><div class=\"fx\" id=\"ind01\"><div><ul><li>Core &amp; façade coordination</li><li>Vertical MEP routing</li><li>Structural transfer levels</li></ul><p class=\"ind-go\"><a class=\"u\" href=\"/industries/high-rise-buildings/\">BIM for high-rise buildings &rarr;</a></p></div></div></li><li><button aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"ind02\"><b>02</b><strong>Commercial Developments</strong><span>Offices, malls and mixed-use schemes with tenant fit-out interfaces.</span><em aria-hidden=\"true\"></em></button><div class=\"fx\" id=\"ind02\"><div><ul><li>Shell &amp; core vs fit-out</li><li>Services coordination</li><li>Phased delivery</li></ul><p class=\"ind-go\"><a class=\"u\" href=\"/industries/commercial/\">BIM for commercial developments &rarr;</a></p></div></div></li><li><button aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"ind03\"><b>03</b><strong>Residential Developments</strong><span>Repeatable unit types and large-volume documentation.</span><em aria-hidden=\"true\"></em></button><div class=\"fx\" id=\"ind03\"><div><ul><li>Typology libraries</li><li>Schedule-driven documentation</li><li>Villa &amp; apartment coordination</li></ul><p class=\"ind-go\"><a class=\"u\" href=\"/industries/residential/\">BIM for residential developments &rarr;</a></p></div></div></li><li><button aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"ind04\"><b>04</b><strong>Hospitality</strong><span>Complex interiors, MEP density and brand-standard detailing.</span><em aria-hidden=\"true\"></em></button><div class=\"fx\" id=\"ind04\"><div><ul><li>Joinery detailing</li><li>BOH/FOH coordination</li><li>Custom FF&amp;E</li></ul><p class=\"ind-go\"><a class=\"u\" href=\"/industries/hospitality/\">BIM for hospitality &rarr;</a></p></div></div></li><li><button aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"ind05\"><b>05</b><strong>Healthcare</strong><span>Dense services and strict clearance requirements.</span><em aria-hidden=\"true\"></em></button><div class=\"fx\" id=\"ind05\"><div><ul><li>Medical gas &amp; MEP density</li><li>Clearance coordination</li><li>Infection-control zoning</li></ul><p class=\"ind-go\"><a class=\"u\" href=\"/industries/healthcare/\">BIM for healthcare &rarr;</a></p></div></div></li><li><button aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"ind06\"><b>06</b><strong>Airports</strong><span>Large federated models with systems-heavy terminals.</span><em aria-hidden=\"true\"></em></button><div class=\"fx\" id=\"ind06\"><div><ul><li>Baggage systems</li><li>Large-model federation</li><li>Airside/landside interfaces</li></ul><p class=\"ind-go\"><a class=\"u\" href=\"/industries/airports/\">BIM for airports &rarr;</a></p></div></div></li><li><button aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"ind07\"><b>07</b><strong>Rail &amp; Metro</strong><span>Linear infrastructure with station-level building coordination.</span><em aria-hidden=\"true\"></em></button><div class=\"fx\" id=\"ind07\"><div><ul><li>Alignment-based modelling</li><li>Station MEP</li><li>Utility diversions</li></ul><p class=\"ind-go\"><a class=\"u\" href=\"/industries/rail-metro/\">BIM for rail &amp; metro &rarr;</a></p></div></div></li><li><button aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"ind08\"><b>08</b><strong>Roads &amp; Infrastructure</strong><span>Corridors, drainage and utilities delivered through Civil BIM.</span><em aria-hidden=\"true\"></em></button><div class=\"fx\" id=\"ind08\"><div><ul><li>Corridor modelling</li><li>Utility crossing checks</li><li>Quantity extraction</li></ul><p class=\"ind-go\"><a class=\"u\" href=\"/industries/roads-infrastructure/\">BIM for roads &amp; infrastructure &rarr;</a></p></div></div></li><li><button aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"ind09\"><b>09</b><strong>Industrial Facilities</strong><span>Process-adjacent buildings, steel structures and heavy services.</span><em aria-hidden=\"true\"></em></button><div class=\"fx\" id=\"ind09\"><div><ul><li>Steel detailing</li><li>Equipment clearance</li><li>Pipe racks</li></ul><p class=\"ind-go\"><a class=\"u\" href=\"/industries/industrial/\">BIM for industrial facilities &rarr;</a></p></div></div></li><li><button aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"ind10\"><b>10</b><strong>Interior Fit-Out</strong><span>Fast programmes with tight coordination to base-build.</span><em aria-hidden=\"true\"></em></button><div class=\"fx\" id=\"ind10\"><div><ul><li>Joinery &amp; ceilings</li><li>Reflected ceiling coordination</li><li>As-built capture</li></ul><p class=\"ind-go\"><a class=\"u\" href=\"/industries/interior-fitout/\">BIM for interior fit-out &rarr;</a></p></div></div></li><li><button aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"ind11\"><b>11</b><strong>Data Centers</strong><span>Dense MEP, cooling and power distribution in mission-critical buildings.</span><em aria-hidden=\"true\"></em></button><div class=\"fx\" id=\"ind11\"><div><ul><li>Cooling &amp; power routing</li><li>Containment coordination</li><li>Phased fit-out of data halls</li></ul><p class=\"ind-go\"><a class=\"u\" href=\"/industries/data-centers/\">BIM for data centers &rarr;</a></p></div></div></li><li><button aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"ind12\"><b>12</b><strong>Education</strong><span>Schools and campuses with repeatable spaces and strict programmes.</span><em aria-hidden=\"true\"></em></button><div class=\"fx\" id=\"ind12\"><div><ul><li>Classroom typologies</li><li>Services coordination</li><li>Phased campus delivery</li></ul><p class=\"ind-go\"><a class=\"u\" href=\"/industries/education/\">BIM for education &rarr;</a></p></div></div></li></ul>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"bone pad\" aria-label=\"Client testimonials\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Testimonials</p><h2 class=\"h2\">In our clients&rsquo; <em>words.</em></h2></div><a class=\"btn dark\" href=\"/testimonials/\">All testimonials <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div><div class=\"tst\"><figure class=\"tst-i rv\"><blockquote><p>I would like to express my sincere appreciation to ENGISOFT and their team for their efforts and seamless BIM services, complete BIM coordination and onsite BIM support.</p></blockquote><figcaption><b>Mr. Amer</b><span>Project Manager, Al Jurf Development Project L.L.C.</span><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-services/bim-coordination/\">BIM Coordination</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tst-i rv\"><blockquote><p>ENGISOFT has met all its commitments and deadlines and provided us with quality BIM services with coordination. Hope to work with your team again soon.</p></blockquote><figcaption><b>Mr. Jairaj</b><span>Project Manager, Gulf Prefab House Factory L.L.C.</span><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-services/bim-modeling/\">BIM Modeling</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tst-i rv\"><blockquote><p>It was really nice working with ENGISOFT and its team on the Expo project for infrastructure and landscaping BIM modelling. We appreciate your effort and continuous support.</p></blockquote><figcaption><b>Mr. Sarvana</b><span>Project Manager, Proscape L.L.C.</span><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-services/infrastructure-bim/\">Infrastructure BIM</a></figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"paper pad\" aria-label=\"Locations\">\n  <div class=\"wrap wf\">\n    <div><p class=\"lab\">Where we work</p><h2 class=\"h2\">From Dubai, <em>for the region.</em></h2>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Dubai-based. GCC-ready. Global by remote delivery: onsite across the UAE, the GCC on site or remote, and remote teams for the US, UK, Australia, Singapore and Europe.</p>\n    <a class=\"btn dark\" style=\"margin-top:34px\" href=\"/locations/\">All locations <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div>\n    <ul class=\"wlist\"><li><a href=\"/locations/uae/\"><span>01</span>UAE<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></li><li><a href=\"/locations/dubai/\"><span>02</span>Dubai<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></li><li><a href=\"/locations/abu-dhabi/\"><span>03</span>Abu Dhabi<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></li><li><a href=\"/locations/sharjah/\"><span>04</span>Sharjah<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></li><li><a href=\"/locations/ajman/\"><span>05</span>Ajman<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></li><li><a href=\"/loca